      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ask Zev · Setup\n\n1. Assign Basic Auth to the Embedded Chat trigger and an OpenAI credential to the chat model and embeddings.\n\n2. Apply zev-knowledge-view.sql in the vector database and assign a Postgres credential that can read only the Zev view for retrieval. Keep Skip Table Initialization enabled.\n\n3. Assign a Postgres credential for the dedicated zev_chat_memory table.\n\n4. Publish and configure the live Zev Worker with the HTTPS Chat URL and Basic authorization header.",
